\label{lemma-absolutely-integrally-closed}
Let $A$ be a ring. The following are equivalent
\begin{enumerate}
\item $A$ is absolutely integrally closed, and
\item any monic $f \in A[T]$ has a root in $A$.
\end{enumerate}

